1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,404
Something is reproducing at 145 degrees Fahrenheit

2
00:00:05,404 --> 00:00:10,808
Incendiamoeba cascadensis, the fire amoeba

3
00:00:10,808 --> 00:00:16,211
A complex cell, a eukaryote, like the cells in you

4
00:00:16,211 --> 00:00:22,290
A new heat record for complex life

5
00:00:22,290 --> 00:00:28,370
Survived 158 F for five minutes, in a protective state

6
00:00:28,370 --> 00:00:33,773
Complex life was thought to stop at 140 F

7
00:00:33,773 --> 00:00:38,502
Syracuse team, Rappaport and Oliverio, published in Cell

8
00:00:38,502 --> 00:00:43,230
The limits of life keep moving
